            {
              "description": "=**Connection**\nSrc IP: {{$json.connection.src_ip}}\nDst IP: {{$json.connection.dst_ip}}\nDomain: {{$json.connection.domain || \"None\"}}\nTime: {{ new Date($json.connection.timestamp).toLocaleString('en-US', { hour12: false }) }}\n\n** Threat IP Source **\n{{$json.ipHits.length\n  ? [...new Set($json.ipHits.map(h => h.intel_source))].join(\"\\n\")\n  : \"None\"\n}}\n\n** Threat Domain Source **\n{{$json.domainHits.length\n  ? [...new Set($json.domainHits.map(h => h.intel_source))].join(\"\\n\")\n  : \"None\"\n}}\n\n**Intel:**\n{{$json.intel}}",
              "color": "={{$json.domainHits.length && $json.ipHits.length ? 16711680 : 16753920}}",
              "title": "🚨 Threat Intelligence Alert"
